  <section class="hero" style="padding: 4rem 1.25rem;">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Our Story</h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">From a single espresso shot to a neighbourhood staple — brewed with passion since 2019.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-story">
    <p>Brew &amp; Bean was born from a simple belief: that great coffee has the power to bring people together. What started as a small cart at the local farmer's market has grown into a warm, welcoming café in the heart of the community.</p>
    <p>We source our beans directly from small-batch growers in Ethiopia, Colombia, and Guatemala — ensuring every cup supports ethical farming practices and delivers exceptional flavour. Our baristas are trained artisans who treat each drink as a craft.</p>
    <p>Whether you're stopping in for your morning espresso or settling in for an afternoon with a latte and a book, Brew &amp; Bean is your home away from home.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-mission">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-icon">🌱</div>
        <h3>Quality First</h3>
        <p>We source only the finest single-origin beans and roast them in small batches to ensure peak freshness and flavour in every cup.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Community</h3>
        <p>Our café is more than a place to grab coffee — it's a gathering space for neighbours, remote workers, and friends to connect.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-item">
        <div class="mission-icon">♻️</div>
        <h3>Sustainability</h3>
        <p>From compostable cups to ethically traded beans, we're committed to reducing our footprint while serving the best coffee possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-location">
    <h2 class="section-title">Find Us</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">We'd love to welcome you in person</p>
    <div class="location-card">
